    "text": "An architect is troubleshooting a scenario where a user with the ANALYST role can see data that should be masked by a dynamic masking policy. The policy checks CURRENT_ROLE() = 'DATA_STEWARD'. The user's primary role is ANALYST, but DATA_STEWARD is one of their secondary roles. What is the issue?",
