    "text": "An enterprise data platform team runs nightly batch jobs using the Snowflake Python connector. A job that processes 50 queries sequentially takes too long. The architect proposes using execute_async() to run queries concurrently, then checking status and retrieving results. What potential issue should the architect address with this approach?",
