    "text": "An analyst runs an identical query twice within 15 minutes. The first execution takes 30 seconds, but the second returns instantly. The analyst then modifies the underlying table with a single INSERT statement and reruns the same query, which again takes 30 seconds. Which cache behavior explains this?",
